sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0> a pk:Claim ;
        rdfs:label "Aspergillus nidulans Turing onset wavelength at 12.84 µm (nominal 13 µm), Holocene 0 Ma faithfully reproduces Aspergillus nidulans morphology" ;
        dct:description "The simulation script(s) models/2026-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0.py, docs/media/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif, datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json, datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib, datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/README.md implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Aspergillus nidulans specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is carried by the MorphoEval rubric assessments." ;
        dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/README.md>,
            <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json>,
            <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib>,
            <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/docs/media/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif>,
            <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/models/2026-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0.py> ;
        pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/models/2026-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0.py, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/docs/media/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/README.md; output: docs/media/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png; organism: Aspergillus nidulans; environment: python 3.12, numpy 2.5.4, matplotlib Agg, Pillow 13.0.0, scipy 1.18.1; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Turing (1952): diffusion-driven instability and a critical wavenumber. | Schnakenberg (1979): the a - u + u^2 v / b - u^2 v kinetics. | Adams, Wieser and Yu (1998) and Clutterbuck (1969): conidial pigment development in A. nidulans, without a reaction-diffusion wavelength. | Trinci (1974): radial hyphal-colony expansion.; reconstructed_in_script: Jacobian, trace, determinant, cross term, discriminant, k_c and λ_c = 1.284e-05 m on a periodic grid with D_v/D_u = 9.295. | Equal-diffusion ablation, D_v sweep of λ_c, and PDE mode-growth versus the analytical eigenvalue. | Colony observable I = S * (1 - α + α (0.55 + 0.90 û)) with α = 0.12, revealed by a radial front.; transfer_boundary: The 13 µm label is the slot detail scale, not a length measured on the colony photograph. The photograph does not resolve 13 µm. | (u, v) are not identified with the wA polyketide or yA laccase proteins.; does_not_claim: Does not claim the spiral colony was predicted ab initio. The photograph supplies the macroscopic optical density. | Does not claim a predecessor chronospecies. The series is 1/1 at 0 Ma; the only comparison is to the 10 µm tier floor.]; phenomenon_size: 12 µm (1.2e-05 m, log10=-4.921 m, tier=4_cellular_10um); species_scale_ladder (10 runs from 12 µm to 3.5 cm): 12 µm:aspergillus-nidulans-bioelectric-polarity, 43 µm:aspergillus-nidulans-vertex-packing, 768 µm:aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength, 1.5 mm:aspergillus-nidulans-clock-wavefront, 2.5 mm:aspergillus-nidulans-morphogen-condensation, 3.2 mm:aspergillus-nidulans-flux-canalization, 3.5 mm:aspergillus-nidulans-elastic-buckling, 4.1 mm:aspergillus-nidulans-branching-tree" ;
        pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-5193(79)90042-0>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fbr.2009.08.001>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1093/genetics/63.2.317>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1098/rstb.1952.0012>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1099/00221287-81-1-225>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1128/MMBR.62.1.35-54.1998> .
    <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/README.md> a schema:SoftwareSourceCode ;
        rdfs:label "datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/README.md" ;
        schema:codeRepository <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib> .
    <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json> a schema:SoftwareSourceCode ;
        rdfs:label "datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json" ;
        schema:codeRepository <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib> .
    <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib> a schema:SoftwareSourceCode ;
        rdfs:label "datasets/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib" ;
        schema:codeRepository <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib> .
    <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/docs/media/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif> a schema:SoftwareSourceCode ;
        rdfs:label "docs/media/aspergillus_nidulans_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif" ;
        schema:codeRepository <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib> .
    <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/models/2026-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0.py> a schema:SoftwareSourceCode ;
        rdfs:label "models/2026-delphi10000-aspergillus-nidulans-turing-wavelength-s0.py" ;
        schema:codeRepository <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib> ;
        schema:programmingLanguage "Python" .
}

